# codification.allow -- per-repo codification allowlist (empty template).
# Format: "<class> <repo-relative-path-or-glob>"; '#' starts a comment line.
# Classes that accept entries: crlf, emoji, path (bom and nul never do).
# A trailing "*" is a shell-case glob (matches across "/").
# Every entry must cite a recorded decision in the repo's decision log:
# adding an entry is a recorded decision, not a silent exemption.
# Example entry (remove the leading '#' to activate):
# path docs/legacy/imported-inventory.md
